{"aliases":[],"ancestry":{"derived_from":[],"mutation_dimensions":["currency_scarcity","price_variation","shop_inventory_size","restocking_mechanics"],"observed_in":["cross-game design analysis"],"source_games":["broguece","cataclysm-bn","crawl","nethack"]},"concept_type":"design_primitive","concrete_examples":[{"description":"In NetHack, players can find shops in the dungeon where they can buy and sell items for zorkmids, the game's currency. Players must evaluate the value of items they find, deciding whether to sell them for immediate currency or keep them for their own use, adding layers of strategic decision-making to resource management.","game":"nethack","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7e5b-a659-dc0465421413","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1075-7dbf-a51b-c713e9c26615","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-787f-a72b-53ecd0e67e57","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7316-97a8-fb33968a55b8","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7a18-8a2f-a0684b6dd106","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-77be-843d-023b929be9dd","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7bac-b269-41b82a62a658","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-71d0-97c3-a2ceb6107f64","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7b6a-99c6-85f213529fdf","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02f80-1076-7ff5-afc2-a68c3bd836c0"],"source_file":""},{"description":"In Broguece, players can find various items in dungeons that can be sold to NPCs for currency, which can then be used to purchase upgrades or other items in the shop, fostering strategic decisions about whether to use items immediately or save them for later transactions.","game":"broguece","record_refs":["urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-026c-7e6b-a036-cc9dd7a859a5","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-025c-75eb-b046-a0b5cd3e87bb","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-023c-789f-bd54-277b32f37159","urn:roguelike-games-ib:record:01a02b9d-028a-7100-8af6-9a3e238ca420","urn:ro